  GU__Vmu_du notes ```
Mucosa (enterocytes) of the segment: its share of the tissue of the region by the
transit time.

`Vmu_du = f_mucosa_volume * Vsi * (1 dimensionless - f_vas_si) * 0.0744792 dimensionless`
```
  GU__f_mucosa_volume notes ```
the mucosa (enterocyte layer) as a tenth of the tissue volume of small and large
intestine, `volume_fraction * V<region> * (1 - f_vas) * share` per segment with its transit share of the region; carved out of the
wall for a substance with mucosa species; it enters the dynamics of the mucosa only,
not the steady state first-pass extraction of the flow-limited mucosa

Source:

- Choice of a library of pkpdsim (PBPK or machine perfusion), not a value of the literature; the notes of the value give the reasoning.
```
