  Chv_blood_api notes ```
Blood concentration of the hepatic vein. An observer: an assignment rule which changes
no state.

`Chv_blood_api = BP_api * Chv_api`
```
  Carm_api notes ```
Plasma concentration of an arm vein sample: the venous outflows of the organs and
the arterial plasma mixed with the weights of the preset. Plasma data without a stated
sampling site map to it. An observer: an assignment rule which changes no state.

`Carm_api = w_arm_sk * Cout_sk_api + w_arm_mu * Cout_mu_api`
