  Chv_api_m1 notes ```
Plasma concentration of the hepatic vein: the outflow of the liver mixed with the
portosystemic shunt by their flows. An observer: an assignment rule which changes
no state.

`Chv_api_m1 = ((1 dimensionless - f_shunt) * Qh * Cout_li_api_m1 + f_shunt * (Qha * Car_api_m1 + Qpo * Cpo_api_m1)) / Qh`
```
  Cout_li_api_m1 notes ```
Plasma concentration of the blood leaving the organ.

`Cout_api_m1 = Cpl_api_m1`
```
  Chv_free_api_m1 notes ```
Unbound plasma concentration of the hepatic vein. An observer: an assignment rule
which changes no state.

`Chv_free_api_m1 = fu_api_m1 * Chv_api_m1`
```
  Chv_blood_api_m1 notes ```
Blood concentration of the hepatic vein. An observer: an assignment rule which changes
no state.

`Chv_blood_api_m1 = BP_api_m1 * Chv_api_m1`
```
  Carm_api_m1 notes ```
Plasma concentration of an arm vein sample: the venous outflows of the organs and
the arterial plasma mixed with the weights of the preset. Plasma data without a stated
sampling site map to it. An observer: an assignment rule which changes no state.

`Carm_api_m1 = w_arm_sk * Cout_sk_api_m1 + w_arm_mu * Cout_mu_api_m1`
